00:07:42,857 --> 00:07:48,857
The Tomb is a drama, horror, thriller film directed by Ulli Lommel.

3
00:11:34,285 --> 00:11:40,285
Imprisoning a group of people in a living hell of darkness and
death the Puppetmaster controls the fate of each one.

4
