One by one, the captives awake in agonizing pain—some are
slightly injured, others are fatally wounded.

5
00:19:17,142 --> 00:19:23,142
The survivors are also mentally tortured by the unseen villain, who
demands that there can be only one winner at this game.

6
00:23:08,571 --> 00:23:14,571
Tara Griffin, played by Victoria Ullmann.

7
00:27:00,000 --> 00:27:06,000
Billy Tearford, played by Christian Behm.

8
00:30:51,428 --> 00:30:57,428
Morris, played by Gerard Griesbaum.

9
00:34:42,857 --> 00:34:48,857
Robert, played by Michael Barbour.

10
00:38:34,285 --> 00:38:40,285
