12
00:46:17,142 --> 00:46:23,142
HP Lovecraft's The Tomb is a 2007 American horror film directed by Ulli Lommel and starring
Victoria Ullmann, Christian Behm, Gerard Griesbaum, and Michael Barbour.

13
00:50:08,571 --> 00:50:14,571
It is supposedly based on H.P.

14
00:54:00,000 --> 00:54:06,000
Lovecraft's 1917 story, "The Tomb".

15
00:57:51,428 --> 00:57:57,428
However, the plot of the film is completely
unrelated to the Lovecraft short story.

16
01:01:42,857 --> 01:01:48,857
The film was compared to the 2004 film, Saw, and the
series was mentioned on the box art.

17
01:05:34,285 --> 01:05:40,285
The film is also known simply as The Tomb, but the title on
the DVD case is HP Lovecraft's The Tomb.

18
01:09:25,714 --> 01:09:31,714
However, on the film itself, the title is given as "H.P.

19
01:13:17,142 --> 01:13:23,142
Lovecraft The Tomb", with no apostrophe or 's'.

20
01:17:08,571 --> 01:17:14,571
The tone is intense and dark and emotional.
